<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK SLOVNAFT H1 GROSS RISES SHARPLY.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK SLOVNAFT H1 GROSS RISES SHARPLY.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six-month period ending June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of crowns).</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			1,456.242	   291.403</p>
<p> Operating revenues		 20,564.290	16,197.094</p>
<p> Operating costs		    18,352.971	15,649.451</p>
<p> Operating profit		    2,211.319	   547.643</p>
<p> Profit from regular activities  1,445.302	   293.917</p>
<p>Reveues from financial</p>
<p>  operation			    3,391.713	   212.130</p>
<p> Financial costs		     4,141.246	   456.856</p>
<p>Result from financial</p>
<p>  operations			    -749.533	  -253.726</p>
<p> Total loans			  10,034.372	 6,437.540</p>
<p> Long-term loans		     6,456.975	 2,228.199</p>
<p> Short-term loans		    3,577.397	 4,209.341</p>
<p> Reserves				  795.930	   415.550</p>
<p> Basic capital			16,468.953	16,468.953</p>
<p> Total assets			 40,268.983	33,562.629</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Slovnaft a.s.. The company is Slovakia's sole oil refiner and its petrol station chain accounts for 80 percent of the country's petrol market.</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
